- Selamat datang.

37
00:05:35,158 --> 00:05:37,718
Peletakan yang tepat.

38
00:05:38,459 --> 00:05:39,949
Terima kasih.

39
00:05:55,359 --> 00:05:57,327
Kau sungguh ada peningkatan..

40
00:05:58,092 --> 00:05:59,491
Terima kasih.

41
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:06,720
"Itulah saat ia menyadari."

42
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:10,190
"Mata suaminya seperti matanya sendiri."

43
00:06:10,850 --> 00:06:13,720
"Dan hasratnya tampak jelas."

44
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:17,490
"Kazumi dengan santai mendekatinya"

45
00:06:17,590 --> 00:06:20,180
