Saat insomniaku sudah berakhir,
aku akan berhenti menulis buku harian ini.

93
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:01,750
Aku ingin berhenti.

94
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:14,050
- Kalau begitu aku pergi dulu.
- Semoga harimu indah.

95
00:12:36,060 --> 00:12:38,550
Cobalah sosisnya.

96
00:12:40,820 --> 00:12:43,350
Bagaimana kalau mencoba
sosis lezat?

97
00:12:48,620 --> 00:12:51,560
Nyonya, bagaimana kalau mencoba
sosis lezat?

98
00:12:52,820 --> 00:12:55,050
