Bagus sekali!

181
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:23,150
Ekspresi yang bagus!

182
00:20:23,620 --> 00:20:25,920
Menggemaskan!

183
00:20:26,020 --> 00:20:27,550
Beri aku cakaran kucing.

184
