185
00:20:31,060 --> 00:20:32,460
Bagus.

186
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:35,860
Teruskan.
Itu bagus, aku suka!

187
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:38,930
Singkirkan tanganmu,
jangan malu-malu.

188
00:20:39,020 --> 00:20:39,990
Bagus sekali.

189
