1339
02:06:10,780 --> 02:06:14,180
Aku takkan pernah berhenti.

1340
02:06:18,250 --> 02:06:21,510
Saat kamu mati,
akankah kamu menemukan Istana itu?

1341
02:06:26,210 --> 02:06:27,840
Aku tak tahu...

1342
02:06:28,580 --> 02:06:29,880
Tapi...

1343
02:06:31,110 --> 02:06:33,450
